            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner (Adam G. Unikowski), according to Petitioner (Adam G. Unikowski), petitioner\u2019s brother earned about $270,000 from the sale of a product called Polar\u202fPure, but the petitioner himself received none of that money."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner (Adam G. Unikowski)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c114cf5d33e9d8560321b3fcaa7fccf85051962def9c5741cbdc5b66eab5661c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c114cf5d33e9-0000-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner (Adam G. Unikowski), according to Petitioner (Adam G. Unikowski), the United States seeks to hold the petitioner jointly and severally liable for the entire $270,000 under 18\u202fU.S.C.\u202f\u00a7\u202f853."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c114cf5d33e9d8560321b3fcaa7fccf85051962def9c5741cbdc5b66eab5661c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c114cf5d33e9-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 52,
              "start": 51
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the core legal question is whether the term \u201cobtain\u201d in \u00a7\u202f853(a)(1) imposes joint\u2011and\u2011several liability on co\u2011conspirators who did not directly obtain the proceeds."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Government",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c114cf5d33e9d8560321b3fcaa7fccf85051962def9c5741cbdc5b66eab5661c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c114cf5d33e9-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 43,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Government, a related issue is whether the government may rely on the substitute\u2011assets provision of \u00a7\u202f853(p) to forfeit property indirectly linked to the proceeds."
      }
    ],
